      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Naafiri hurls up to two daggers, each inflicting bleed, or each inflicting bonus damage if the target is already bleeding. Packmates leap to attack the first champion or monster hit by this skill.",
      "summary_zh": "纳亚菲利猛投出两根犬牙，每根都会施加流血效果，或在目标已经流血时施加额外伤害。 狗群伙伴们会跃向并攻击被这个技能命中的英雄或野怪。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1587277:4025704"
      ]
    },
    {
